# What is NOT sent as build context.
#
# Both images are built from the repository root — the mock API server is
# compiled from test/mockapi, and the test runner copies
# scripts/ci-install-chore.sh — so without this the whole history and every
# build artefact goes to the daemon on each build, which is slow and puts
# host-built binaries where a container might pick them up.
.git
build/
dist/
tmp/
coverage.out
*.a
*.h
